{"id":"023cbda9c2e76b96","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-combinatorial-completeness.md","title":"组合完备性","display":"thm-combinatorial-completeness — 组合完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-combinatorial-completeness","aliases":["56-thm-combinatorial-completeness"],"display":"thm-combinatorial-completeness — 组合完备性","depends_on":["[[56-thm-bracket-abstraction]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Theorem 3.3.9 and proof, printed p68","source_ocr_block":"89","verification_status":"source-proof-read; conditions-made-explicit"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-combinatorial-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-combinatorial-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-combinatorial-completeness — 组合完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab87a8c0ba50d579\" href=\"?note=ab87a8c0ba50d579\" title=\"56-thm-bracket-abstraction\">56-thm-bracket-abstraction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Theorem 3.3.9 and proof, printed p68"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"89"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-read; conditions-made-explicit"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(t\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\in V\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\in V\\)</span> 两两不同，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span>；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]t\">\\(F=[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]t\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(F),\\qquad Fx_1\\cdots x_n\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(F),\\qquad Fx_1\\cdots x_n\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 3.3.9 及证明（印刷 p68，OCR 页块89）。按变量列表长度归纳，逐次应用括号抽象性质。这里显式给出所有自由变量都在列表中的条件，从而 F 确实是闭组合子；不凭“完备性”名称推导任何逻辑完备性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-bracket-abstraction","status":"resolved","id":"ab87a8c0ba50d579","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-bracket-abstraction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"t\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"F=[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(F),\\qquad Fx_1\\cdots x_n\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*t.","display":true}],"bytes":1088,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-combinatorial-completeness.md]]"}],"outgoing":["ab87a8c0ba50d579"]}